OL,3,AFrom 'dog fruit' to darling: India's
OL,4,Aavocado boom
OL,5,
OL,6,F"We never planted avocado as our main
OL,7,Fcrop. We introduced it as a shade tree
OL,8,Ffor coffee plantations, and only later
OL,9,Frealised it could become a profitable
OL,10,Fbusiness," he says.
